{"id":"resp_b28932d012c75889","created_at":1795617916,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"metadata":null,"model":"gpt-oss-120b","object":"response","output":[{"id":"rs_874c1c64ac96d304","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"We need to fix Turtle syntax error: the previous SHACL has a line comment separator with many hyphens? The error says \"Prefix ':' not bound\" at line with \":ShipBoundaryShape\". Means missing prefix declaration for default prefix \":\"? In SHACL, you need to define a base prefix prefix \":\" binding. Usually you include @prefix : <#> . or similar. So need to add prefix for ':' before use. Also ensure proper syntax: after each property list there should not be trailing commas before closing bracket? In SHACL, property shapes within sh:property have a list of constraints separate by ';'. The given seems correct. Need to add a base prefix, e.g., @prefix : <http://example.org/shapes#> . Also ensure no stray commas (they used commas after property list in another shape?). Actually they used commas after sh:property entries? In :ShellInclinationAngleValueShape, they have two sh:property blocks separated by ';' then a final '.' after shape. That's fine.\n\nAlso need to ensure that numericValue property path uses qudt:numericValue which is defined as property, fine.\n\nSo add a prefix for ':'.\n\nWill produce full SHACL with added prefix line after other prefixes.\n\nAlso maybe need to close comment lines correctly; but comment lines are fine.\n\nThus produce revised SHACL with added @prefix : <http://example.org/shapes#> . Also maybe need to ensure qudt prefixes include trailing slash? they have qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> . That's fine.\n\nReturn within <BEGIN_SHACL>...<END_SHACL>.\n\n","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":null,"status":null},{"id":"msg_b5a9e1818875c7e9","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"<BEGIN_SHACL>\n@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .\n@prefix nltl: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#> .\n@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .\n@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .\n@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .\n@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .\n@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n# Default prefix for local shape IRIs – can be any IRI that serves as a base.\n@prefix :     <http://example.org/shapes#> .\n\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Shape for ships – enforce that each ship has a bottom‑region boundary\n# point whose shell inclination angle is exactly 7 deg (requirement I2‑005,\n# clause I2.2.5).\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n:ShipBoundaryShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass nltl:ship ;\n    rdfs:comment \"I2.2.5 – The boundary between the bottom and lower regions is to be taken at the point where the shell is inclined 7° from horizontal.\" ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path nltl:hasBottomRegionLowerRegionBoundaryPoint ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:node :HullBoundaryPointShape ;\n        sh:description \"Each ship must reference a hull‑boundary point that defines the bottom/lower‑region limit.\" ;\n    ] .\n\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Shape for the hull‑boundary point – it must carry a shell inclination\n# angle quantity.\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n:HullBoundaryPointShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass nltl:hullBoundaryPoint ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path nltl:shellInclinationAngle ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:node :ShellInclinationAngleValueShape ;\n        sh:description \"The hull boundary point must have a shell inclination angle quantity.\" ;\n    ] .\n\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Shape for the QUDT QuantityValue representing the shell inclination\n# angle – it must be 7 deg.\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n:ShellInclinationAngleValueShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass qudt:QuantityValue ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n        sh:hasValue \"7\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n        sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n        sh:description \"Numeric value of the shell inclination angle must be 7.\" ;\n    ] ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path qudt:unit ;\n        sh:hasValue unit:DEG ;\n        sh:class unit:DEG ;\n        sh:description \"Unit of the shell inclination angle must be degrees.\" ;\n    ] .\n<END_SHACL>","type":"output_text","logprobs":null}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":null}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":1.0,"background":false,"max_output_tokens":16000,"max_tool_calls":null,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt":null,"prompt_cache_options":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":null,"reasoning":null,"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"auto","status":"completed","text":null,"top_logprobs":null,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":19825,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":320,"cache_write_tokens":19504,"input_tokens_per_turn":[19825],"cached_tokens_per_turn":[320]},"output_tokens":981,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":332,"tool_output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_per_turn":[981],"tool_output_tokens_per_turn":[0]},"total_tokens":20806},"user":null,"presence_penalty":0.0,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"input_messages":null,"output_messages":null}